# Gitignored build inputs carried into new git worktrees so they aren't born broken.
# Without the prebuilt native addon, any test that touches pi-natives fails with
# "Failed to load pi_natives native addon" — an environmental error that looks like
# a logic failure. Rebuilding from source needs the Rust toolchain and is slow, so
# reuse the already-built addon instead.
packages/natives/native/*.node
